===== store-leg =====
leg: store-leg
leg-purpose: store a document with known, fixed bytes in the content repository and record the identifier, the name and the content type the application resolved for it
leg-observed: no
leg-not-observed-because: state mutation is not permitted (ALLOW_SMOKE_MUTATIONS is not set to 1), and a document cannot be stored read-only
request-method: POST
request-url: https://arkcase-ce.local/arkcase/api/latest/service/ecm/upload
