resolved-content-type: not-observed
declared-content-length: not-observed
stored-object-identifier: none
stored-object-name-recorded-by-application: not-observed
stored-object-mime-type-recorded-by-application: not-observed
----- end store-leg -----

===== retrieve-leg =====
leg: retrieve-leg
leg-purpose: read the same document back out of the content repository and record the content type it resolves to, the length it declares and the digest of the bytes returned
leg-observed: no
leg-not-observed-because: state mutation is not permitted (ALLOW_SMOKE_MUTATIONS is not set to 1), so no document was stored for this leg to read back
request-method: GET
request-url: https://arkcase-ce.local/arkcase/api/latest/plugin/ecm/download
document-name: arkcase-smoke-probe.txt
stored-object-identifier: none
